{"suttaId":"tha-ap99","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5063,5087],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"tha-ap99:0.3":"Madhupiṇḍikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap99:1.1":"“Vipine [vivane (syā. aṭṭha.)] kānane disvā, appasadde nirākule;","tha-ap99:1.3":"Siddhatthaṃ isinaṃ seṭṭhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ.","tha-ap99:2.1":"“Nibbutattaṃ [nibbutaggaṃ (ka.), nibbūtikaṃ (syā.)] mahānāgaṃ, nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā;","tha-ap99:2.3":"Osadhiṃva virocantaṃ, devasaṅghanamassitaṃ.","tha-ap99:3.1":"“Vitti mamāhu tāvade [vitti me pāhunā tāva (sī. syā.)], ñāṇaṃ uppajji tāvade;","tha-ap99:3.3":"Vuṭṭhitassa samādhimhā, madhuṃ datvāna satthuno.","tha-ap99:4.1":"“Vanditvā satthuno pāde, pakkāmiṃ pācināmukho;","tha-ap99:4.3":"Catuttiṃsamhi kappamhi, rājā āsiṃ sudassano.","tha-ap99:5.1":"“Madhu bhisehi savati, bhojanamhi ca tāvade;","tha-ap99:5.3":"Madhuvassaṃ pavassittha, pubbakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap99:6.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ madhuṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap99:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, madhudānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap99:7.1":"“Catuttiṃse ito kappe, cattāro te sudassanā;","tha-ap99:7.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap99:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap99:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā madhupiṇḍiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap99:10.1":"Madhupiṇḍikattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
